  "ruleText": "Rev 1205.01 Relief. Relief shall be processed pursuant to RSA 198:61 within 120 days of the department’s receipt of the claim and all required documentation as provided in Rev 1203.02.\n\nSource. #7154, EMERGENCY, eff 12-13-99, EXPIRED: 6-10-00\n\nNew. #7365, eff 9-19-00; ss by #7910, eff 6-25-03; ss by #9946, eff 6-23-11; ss by #12923, eff 11-26-19",
